# Secrets & local environment — never commit real credentials.
# (The Firebase *web* config in src/firebase-config.js is not a secret and
# is committed deliberately once Joe plugs in his project values; service
# account keys and .env files are secrets and stay out.)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*-service-account*.json
serviceAccountKey.json
.firebase/
